				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12377238#post-4338935</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12377238/scp-es-100#post-4338935</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 24 Aug 2019 06:01:12 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Zzuxon</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1496981</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I have had a fear, an irrational intrusive suspicion, almost identical to what is presented in this work, except instead of centering around using elevators, it was centered around either using a bathroom stall or pulling a shirt over your head. I had even considered using this fear to inspire an SCP. Seeing this, I now know I don't need to, the idea has been pulled off far better than I ever would have.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
