				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12377238/scp-es-100#post-4337267</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 22 Aug 2019 06:08:47 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Zafiros</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>575954</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>There are quite a few instances of the word plants being used instead of the word floor. In Spanish floor can be translated as 'piso' or 'planta' the second which can translate to plant. I assume that is where that comes from.</p> 
				 	]]>
