ileiner" >YossiLeiner</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tufto" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3337265&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1566426863" alt="Tufto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3337265)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tufto" >Tufto</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1566426863" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" >djkaktus</a></span><br /> <strong>Link to original:</strong> <a href="http://lafundacionscp.wikidot.com/scp-es-100">SCP-ES-100</a></p> <p>Note from the translators:</p> <blockquote> <p>Our final work of the showcase is here. SCP-ES-100's inspiration was a horror story that the author heard from his brother. The author wanted to pay homage to Series 1-3, starting with an apparently simple anomaly, next he offers background and development seen in Series 2 and finally in the final addendum it shows a complex SCP seen in Series 3. All of that with a good aesthetic and code to make it more Foundation-like.</p> <p>Hope that you enjoy this work. It’s the best one from this author and the fourth highest rated in the Spanish Branch, all in 1 year.</p> </blockquote> <p>For those having difficulty with the password and username, they are presented below.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p><strong>User ID:</strong> j.ashworth</p> <p><strong>Six-numbered Password</strong>: 090707</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> 
